[NARRATIVE]
UID: NAR-MECHANISM-MOOD-REVIEW-LEGEND
TITLE: How to read the verdicts
DEPTH: sketch
AUTHORED_BY: llm
WIDGET: legend
PLACE: card
STATEMENT: >>>
- REQUIREMENT: green: retyped to a requirement; it can be violated: Confidence
- EVIDENCE: teal: retyped to evidence; it records what was observed once: Confidence
- HELD: amber: low confidence; the operator rules, and a split is the likely answer: Proposed retype
- MECHANISM: slate: stayed a mechanism; how something always behaves: Confidence
<<<
